    "finalName": "",
    "description": "When you end your movement adjacent to an opponent, you can spend a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Swift_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Swift Action\">Swift Action</a> to activate this Talent. If the designated opponent <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Moves\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Moves\">Moves</a> or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Withdraws\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Withdraws\">Withdraws</a> before the beginning of your next turn, you can choose to move with that opponent, up to a total distance equal to your current speed.<br><br>Unless your opponent uses the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Withdraw\" title=\"Withdraw\">Withdraw</a> Action or makes an <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Acrobatics\" title=\"Acrobatics\">Acrobatics</a> check to avoid <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Attacks_of_Opportunity\" title=\"Attacks of Opportunity\">Attacks of Opportunity</a>, its movement provokes an <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Attack_of_Opportunity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack of Opportunity\">Attack of Opportunity</a> from you for the first square moved as normal (but no subsequent squares in the same movement). If your target moves farther than your speed, you must still end this movement closer to the target than you began.",
